,"lng":1.200975,"ele":1361.4},{"lat":42.342552,"lng":1.200952,"ele":1362.4},{"lat":42.3426,"lng":1.200922,"ele":1363.2},{"lat":42.342637,"lng":1.200869,"ele":1362.9}]'::jsonb),
('wikiloc', '198094440', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/sant-llorenc-de-morunys-solsones-mola-de-lord-santuari-de-lord-mirador-josep-cases-balmes-del-verge-198094440', 'Sant Llorenç de Morunys (SOLSONÈS) - Mola de Lord, Sanctuary of Lord, Mirador Josep Cases, Balmes del Verger and Sollort', '{"en":"Short loop from Collet del Santuari","ca":"Circular curta des del Collet del Santuari","es":"Circular corta desde el Collet del Santuari"}'::jsonb, 'Sant Llorenç de Morunys (SOLSONÈS) - Mola de Lord, Santuari de Lord, Mirador Josep Cases, Balmes del Verger i Sollort Hiking trail in Sant Llorenç de Morunys, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. --------------------------------- 
