https://www.rocjumper.com/via-ferrata/lista-de-vias-ferratas', '{"en":"This 10 km moderate loop to Roc Galliner ascends via its ridge, starting from Alzina d''Alinyà. The trailhead is accessed by taking the C-463 to Alinyà, then an asphalted road to Alzina d''Alinyà, followed by a well-maintained dirt track to the starting point. The route focuses on the ridge traverse, offering a direct approach to the summit.\n\nThis route is suitable for hikers looking for a moderate challenge with 445m of elevation gain, primarily concentrated on the ridge section. Details on the specific approach and descent are concise, emphasizing the ridge as the main feature.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 10 km al Roc Galliner ascendeix per la seva carena, començant des de l''Alzina d''Alinyà. L''inici del sender s''accedeix prenent la C-463 fins a Alinyà, després una carretera asfaltada fins a l''Alzina d''Alinyà, seguida d''una pista de terra en bon estat fins al punt de partida. La ruta se centra en la travessa de la carena, oferint una aproximació directa al cim.\n\nAquesta ruta és adequada per a excursionistes que busquen un repte moderat amb 445m de desnivell positiu, principalment concentrat en el tram de la carena. Els detalls sobre l''aproximació i el descens són concisos, emfatitzant la carena com a característica principal.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 10 km al Roc Galliner asciende por su cresta, comenzando desde Alzina d''Alinyà. El inicio del sendero se accede tomando la C-463 hasta Alinyà, luego una carretera asfaltada hasta Alzina d''Alinyà, seguida de una pista de tierra en buen estado hasta el punto de partida. La ruta se centra en la travesía de la cresta, ofreciendo una aproximación directa a la cima.\n\nEsta ruta es adecuada para excursionistas que buscan un reto moderado con 445m de desnivel positivo, principalmente concentrado en el tramo de la cresta. Los detalles sobre la aproximación y el descenso son concisos, enfatizando la cresta como característica principal."}'::jsonb, 'RocJumper', 9978, 445, 445, 1624, 1353, 'moderate', 'loop', NULL, 9960, 1501, '2017-10-21', '2017-09', '[{"lat":42.196584,"lng":1.448,"ele":1404.6},{"lat":42.196589,"lng":1.448006,"ele":1404.7},{"lat":42.196585,"lng":1.447995,"ele":1404.5},{"lat":42.196587,"lng":1.44801,"ele":1404.8},{"lat":42.196613,"lng":1.44813,"ele":1406.8},{"lat":42.196661,"lng":1.448233,"ele":1408.7},{"lat":42.196679,"lng":1.448256,"ele":1409.3},{"lat":42.19679,"lng":1.448279,"ele":1410.2},{"lat":42.196884,"lng":1.448238,"ele":1411.5},{"lat":42.196978,"lng":1.448237,"ele":1414},{"lat":42.197072,"lng":1.448287,"ele":1416.6},{"lat":42.197164,"lng":1.448315,"ele":1419.2},{"lat":42.197258,"lng":1.448294,"ele":1421.9},{"lat":42.197333,"lng":1.448204,"ele":1424.2},{"lat":42.197372,"lng":1.44808,"ele":1425.2},{"lat":42.197415,"lng":1.447966,"ele":1426.2},{"lat":42.197516,"lng":1.447906,"ele":1428.3},{"lat":42.197573,"lng":1.447798,"ele":1428.1},{"lat":42.197614,"lng":1.447689,"ele":1427.9},{"lat":42.197643,"lng":1.447566,"ele":1426.5},{"lat":42.197654,"lng":1.44744,"ele":1424.2},{"lat":42.197644,"lng":1.447318,"ele":1421.8},{"lat":42.197634,"lng":1.44718,"ele":1420.5},{"lat":42.197648,"lng":1.447032,"ele":1421.6},{"lat":42.197662,"lng":1.446897,"ele":1425},{"lat":42.197692,"lng":1.446771,"ele":1428.8},{"lat":42.197706,"lng":1.446641,"ele":1430.7},{"lat":42.197742,"lng":1.446522,"ele":1433.3},{"lat":42.197797,"lng":1.446415,"ele":1435.9},{"lat":42.19784,"lng":1.446303,"ele":1437.7},{"lat":42.197855,"lng":1.446181,"ele":1438.2},{"lat":42.197853,"lng":1.446039,"ele":1438.1},{"lat":42.197826,"lng":1.445913,"ele":1437.3},{"lat":42.197788,"lng":1.445798,"ele":1436.3},{"lat":42.19783,"lng":1.445687,"ele":1437.2},{"lat":42.197899,"lng":1.445583,"ele":1438.7},{"lat":42.19798,"lng":1.445491,"ele":1440.3},{"lat":42.198042,"lng":1.445387,"ele":1440.6},{"lat":42.198117,"lng":1.445308,"ele":1440.7},{"lat":42.198182,"lng":1.445214,"ele":1440.9},{"lat":42.198263,"lng":1.445155,"ele":14